{"3639380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Movie Tycoon", "steam_appid": 3639380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Follow Us</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎬 Official Discord for <i>Super Movie Tycoon</i> is now open!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Discord link</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our player community to get:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ First-hand dev logs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Exclusive game news</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Direct communication with the dev team</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✓ Opportunities to participate in beta tests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us now and start your movie tycoon journey!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a movie mogul in Super Movie Tycoon! From script to screen, build your dream team and create blockbusters to conquer Hollywood!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/13717bf499b451c3b8123a24bc377bb8.avif?t=1769140024\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through your creative designs, build a unique cinematic world! From scriptwriting to set construction, from character development to special effects, every detail is crafted by your own hands. Here, you are the director, screenwriter and producer - use your boundless imagination to create your own blockbusters!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/2b2569d63f252a0d06e7f89d2fa491e4.poster.avif?t=1769140024\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/2b2569d63f252a0d06e7f89d2fa491e4.webm?t=1769140024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/2b2569d63f252a0d06e7f89d2fa491e4.mp4?t=1769140024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/d344ba7b13343a2bede65574e8187e62.avif?t=1769140024\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new land plots and carefully plan each professional department to create a highly efficient film production pipeline. Maximize the value of every piece of land and witness the rise of your dream film studio from scratch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/17333d270210d2795250b13b0b834c26.poster.avif?t=1769140024\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/17333d270210d2795250b13b0b834c26.webm?t=1769140024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/17333d270210d2795250b13b0b834c26.mp4?t=1769140024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/290a126988b7b52f84036087ccc8644f.avif?t=1769140024\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit top-tier film talents to build your dream team! From genius screenwriters to ace directors, from veteran crew members to special effects experts, strategically allocate human resources for every position. With professional HR management, inject endless creativity into your film kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/cfca2b3f5e402bdc57c94432f16149f6.poster.avif?t=1769140024\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/cfca2b3f5e402bdc57c94432f16149f6.webm?t=1769140024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/cfca2b3f5e402bdc57c94432f16149f6.mp4?t=1769140024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/8a653e6ead6f243c99992c8509fafbd0.avif?t=1769140024\" width=600 height=128 /></span>Build a Hollywood-level production empire. From budget control to scheduling, use data-driven refined management to optimize every operation. Make your film company stand out in fierce industry competition and create your own entertainment legend! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/fd80fbe9b1e595632f132d0d695b35f8.poster.avif?t=1769140024\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/fd80fbe9b1e595632f132d0d695b35f8.webm?t=1769140024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/fd80fbe9b1e595632f132d0d695b35f8.mp4?t=1769140024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639380/extras/c5fb189d3ab491d9c5ff7b847a1ebc9e.avif?t=1769140024\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your film empire d